Tue Nov 10 12:00:00 UTC 2026 - Rodrigo Brito

- Initial package (lyraos-desktop#22): a GNOME session service that,
  when the screens wake from power saving (DPMS), switches each active
  NVIDIA output to another refresh rate at the same resolution and back,
  with the temporary method of org.gnome.Mutter.DisplayConfig. Re-applying
  the same configuration does not bring the signal back; the mode change
  does. Starts only when nvidia_drm is loaded and installs on its own,
  without lyra-release or the image pulling it in.
